{
  "author": "KC桌面",
  "content": "<section style=\"margin:0 0 22px;padding:18px 16px;border-left:5px solid #C9A227;background:#F7F3E8\"><p style=\"margin:0 0 8px;color:#7A5B12;font-size:14px;font-weight:700\">外资精译</p><p style=\"margin:0;color:#142033;font-size:21px;font-weight:700;line-height:1.4\">摩根大通：硬件网络数据中心观察-Token支出攀升，GPU价格分化</p></section>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">8月的AI基础设施需求数据，呈现出一个并不完全同向的画面。<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700\">JPM</span>最新一期Data Center Watch报告跟踪了三个核心变量：大语言模型的Token消耗与支出、GPU租赁价格、以及内存现货价格。三者合在一起，指向一个需求仍在<span style=\"color:#2F8F5B;font-weight:700\">扩张</span>、但价格信号出现分化的阶段。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">先看最关键的Token支出数据。8月OpenRouter平台上的Token支出环比增长<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">7%</span>，同比增长<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">12倍</span>。这个增速与7月持平，但内部结构发生了明显变化：Token用量环比大增<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">47%</span>，同比<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">28倍</span>，而平均价格环比下降<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">5%</span>。量增价跌的组合，说明需求<span style=\"color:#2F8F5B;font-weight:700\">扩张</span>主要靠低价模型和折扣推动，而非高端模型提价。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:14px 0;text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/YBsHov7VYOWUTyOplSpAjOwEBIyzMoU2bTP62hnm3VMvOy9x1iapl8hXsZJia7AicG2a7Zia8HVdo1SyIWI6FEAcenNCtEWfqawzUpU5tEWOyico/0?from=appmsg\" alt=\"研报原图 1\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:0 auto\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></p>\n<p style=\"margin:14px 0;text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/YBsHov7VYOVbHVichVyH0SibbeUuJqEiaZLUQXa7M7ZhAgL5ccTETWV7woKMtgQlwYThSK3hpt2jhElAnib0xSfAoOPHj4cibuJfIhyy6rOHCIwQ/0?from=appmsg\" alt=\"研报原图 2\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:0 auto\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></p>\n<p style=\"margin:14px 0;text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/YBsHov7VYOV5T8I6BiaDhtJ8UA4A5L5b8ibC9WyEz2w3DdiaW5rOfM0E4bc4GMmCJmHseia208OAZBzSzvosSL816ATTgRaQ9lzJBwiaXJWdPBT0/0?from=appmsg\" alt=\"研报原图 3\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:0 auto\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></p>\n<section style=\"margin:28px 0 0;padding-top:12px;border-top:1px solid #D9DEE7;color:#737D8C;font-size:12px;line-height:1.75\"><p style=\"margin:0 0 8px\">——人工智能免责声明（部分内容由人工智能工具辅助生成）</p><p style=\"margin:0\">撰稿：Leo<br>责编：KC<br>排版：胡桃</p></section>\n<p style=\"margin:14px 0;text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/YBsHov7VYOXv2zWNMGd8cG5zuS4gbzZkwgI6fJuYuTlK64h8ez3ue7R32SvyKMZhiaYQ7pCRibeicNyppR7THaqUr8fmjHBKPOicHpexT8MC04E/0?from=appmsg\" alt=\"KC桌面\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:0 auto\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></p>\n<p style=\"margin:16px 0 0;color:#A3ABB8;font-size:12px;line-height:1.55;text-align:left\">Original report: 79-JPM-Hardware - Networking Data Center Watch- Token Spend Climbs- GPU Pricing Mixed- - Memory Prices March Higher-260826</p>\n<p style=\"margin:16px 0 0;padding:14px 16px;background:#EAF2FB;border-left:4px solid #2E6FB7;color:#152033;font-size:15px;line-height:1.75;font-weight:600\">更新信息参见portal.example.invalid</p>",
